# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Maison Palettia — environment
#
# Copy to `.env.local` for development. On a deploy host, set these in that
# host's own environment panel instead; `.env.local` is gitignored and never
# reaches the server.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# The studio's WhatsApp business number.
#
# Digits only, country code first — no "+", no spaces, no dashes.
# A UAE mobile looks like 9715XXXXXXXX.
#
# Setting this turns on BOTH WhatsApp controls, and nothing else has to change:
#   • desktop (lg and up) ... the floating button, bottom-right
#   • mobile (below lg) ..... the bottom bar's fourth slot, which is Home until
#                             this is set and WhatsApp once it is
#
# Leave it unset or blank and neither appears — a control that opens a chat
# with nobody is worse than no control. Requires a restart/rebuild to take
# effect, because NEXT_PUBLIC_ values are inlined at build time.
NEXT_PUBLIC_WHATSAPP_NUMBER=
